OL,3,GNEWSACharity to end after 30 years over
OL,4,Afinancial risks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity will close after 30 years
OL,7,Fafter revealing its financial and
OL,8,Foperational risks "were too
OL,9,Fsignificant".
OL,11,FAce Anglia based in Stowmarket,
OL,12,FSuffolk, which works with people with
OL,13,Flearning difficulties and autism, will
OL,14,Fshut its doors at the end of February
OL,15,Fnext year.
OL,17,FThe charity said its board of trustees
OL,18,Fhad made the decision following an
OL,19,Fextensive review of its financial
OL,20,Fposition, future funding opportunities
OL,21,Fand the challenges of maintaining a
OL,22,Fsustainable operating model.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
